      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Mirko the Domovoy",
      "content": "Pulcinella's personal name is Mirko Radovidovich Veleshek. He is a Domovoy, one of the six common types of Snowland Fae. The fae were created by the Hyperboreans to surpass humans. Domovoy are short; Mirko is about a head taller than most of his kin. Fae innately command the elements, and the wiki credits him with Hydro. Under the Belyi Tsar fae princes formed Snezhnaya's aristocracy.",
