    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Project Stuzha",
        "Stuzha",
        "energy rationing"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Project Stuzha",
      "content": "Project Stuzha ('severe cold') is a set of energy reforms passed by the Veche to cap public use and redirect the savings, chiefly Kresnik Kristall, to the Armory Palace. It has lasted far longer and cost far more than planned. Pierro and Pulcinella lead it, with Pantalone co-managing.",
