      "key": [
        "Pantalone",
        "Regrator",
        "Northland Bank"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Pantalone",
      "content": "On paper Pulcinella and Pantalone work smoothly together. Columbina reveals they secretly detest each other. Pantalone beat him to the Adventurers' Guild presidency, and Pulcinella vowed the 'grinning madman' would not have all its wealth.",
