    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Tartaglia",
        "Childe",
        "Ajax",
        "Morepesok"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Tartaglia",
      "content": "When fourteen-year-old Ajax came back from the Abyss changed, his father brought him to the Fatui. Pulcinella inducted him 'under the pretext of meting out punishment', ordering him to start from the bottom serving the Tsaritsa. He saw Ajax lacked a politician's qualities, and left his guidance to Capitano.",
