    "6": {
      "uid": 6,
      "key": [
        "Vesna",
        "Miss Fern",
        "Strivozha"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Vesna",
      "content": "Vesna's Character Story 4 shows him visiting the Vila heiress, then a girl of about ten, as her tutor on the Tsaritsa's order. He called her 'my dear Miss Fern' (a nickname cleared with her mother) and told her why House Strivozha is distrusted: her ancestor Gluvasha poisoned Grand Duke Photius with fern mead and then betrayed the rebels to the Tsaritsa.",
