      "comment": "Pulcinella: The Rokot",
      "content": "The Rokot is a civilian group working against Stuzha. Pulcinella calls it 'quite mysterious', says Snezhnaya is fortunate to have civilian groups that handle matters the state cannot officially, and asks the Traveler to give his regards to the Korolevskiy Troupe.",
