      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Glupov and Snezhnograd",
      "content": "Snezhnograd is Snezhnaya's capital and contains the Veche State Hall. Glupov is a satellite city within Snezhnograd and the headquarters of the Fatui, built as a fortress at the Tsaritsa's command. Pulcinella is Mayor of both.",
