    "9": {
      "uid": 9,
      "key": [
        "Ronova",
        "Hroptatyr",
        "The Wise's notebook",
        "Hroptatyr's notebook"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Ronova and Hroptatyr's notebook",
      "content": "In 7.1 Pierro called the Harbingers to vote on unsealing Hroptatyr's notebook. Pulcinella arrived second and voted in favour: the notebook had been sealed for fear Snezhnaya would become a 'Second Khaenri'ah', but the Fatui were already a thorn in the side of the Ruler of Death, which he felt made that concern unnecessary. Afterwards a prism showed them the memory of the young Hroptatyr, The Wise.",
