      "key": [
        "Signora's funeral",
        "A Winter Night's Lazzo"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: Signora's funeral",
      "content": "At Signora's funeral he declared that all work should halt for half a day as the nation mourned her. Pantalone and Arlecchino thought it too brief. Capitano once saw her leave one of Pulcinella's counselling rooms with Pulcinella behind her holding her handbag; neither man ever mentioned it.",
