    "12": {
      "uid": 12,
      "key": [
        "Tsaritsa's portrait",
        "Tsaritsa's New Portrait"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pulcinella: The Tsaritsa's portrait",
      "content": "When the Tsaritsa wanted to know how her subjects saw her, Pulcinella, with Pantalone and other Harbingers, presented a cold, imposing portrait: her stern image would deter ill-intentioned factions and keep Snezhnaya stable. She remarked that his opinions usually represent the whole administrative system and had it hung in the hall of Glupov.",
